{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>夜晚約9時半，仍有不少旅客經新皇崗口岸返港。現場所見，近乎全部自助通道都有開放，每條通道有三至四人排隊，過關流程大致暢順。</p><p></p><p>保安局「口岸通」晚上10時顯示，平均過關輪候時間正常，約是5分鐘。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.BORDER.NIGHT-2230.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026ZRYPqtOiKQ1792423547.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T16:39:08.281842+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":95,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T14:59:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T18:17:51.054872+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T16:37:52.865714+00:00","content_hash":"d0e19632e46372960f6410a3737834ec535ee5af809319a8b74d1c9a334dd771","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}